      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This 4th‑floor apartment offers exceptional brightness and comfort thanks to its dual aspect orientation and two private balconies facing east and west. Morning and evening light fill the home, creating a warm, inviting atmosphere throughout.\r\n\r\nInside, the property is tastefully decorated with a blend of wooden laminate floors and soft carpets, giving each space a stylish yet practical finish. The kitchen with all mod cons is fully equipped for modern living, while a dedicated utility space in the hallway adds valuable convenience.\r\n\r\nThe apartment features two bright and spacious bedrooms, including a superb master en‑suite with both a separate bath and shower — a rare luxury in city apartments. A large family bathroom completes the accommodation with a high‑quality finish.\r\n\r\nResidents also benefit from underground parking and a concierge service, enhancing security, comfort, and day‑to‑day ease.\r\n\r\n• 4th‑floor position with dual aspect\r\n• Tastefully decorated throughout\r\n• Wooden laminate floors & carpets\r\n• Kitchen with all mod cons\r\n• Utility space in hallway\r\n• Two bright, spacious bedrooms\r\n• Master en‑suite with separate bath & shower \r\n• Large family bathroom \r\n• Two balconies — east & west facing \r\n• Underground parking \r\n• Concierge service"
      },
